WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Read a poem in three passes

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.220
First pass. Identify the speaker, the scene and what changes.

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:14.970
Second pass. Underline a striking image or repeated sound. Describe its effect in your own words.

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:21.300
Third pass. State an interpretation and link it to one exact phrase. Explain the connection.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:33.540
A speaker describes an empty courtyard twice. If the poem first presents a gathering and ends there alone, the repeated image can mark the change from belonging to isolation.
